{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elemental Slime is a puzzle platformer game where you use the power of the elements to solve puzzles, interact with the world around you and unravel mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/elements.png?t=1744820521\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/Fire_Element.gif?t=1744820521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...are key to solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to use them cleverly and interact with the environment. <i>Is that a wooden obstacle?</i> Just burn it with a fire slime. <i>Is that a water pool filled with monsters?</i> Just electrocute and stun them for a while with a lightning slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/platformer.png?t=1744820521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/Platformer.gif?t=1744820521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...experience are just like the classic ones.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay attention to timing and make use of the platforms. There are many different types of platforms you can use in harmony. For example; Static, Moving, Vanishing, Slippery, Breakable, Sticky, Conveyor, Hazardous, Floating, Teleporting and Teleporter platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/Puzzles2.png?t=1744820521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/Puzzle_gif.gif?t=1744820521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...can be mind-blowing. Just focus on finding the missing pieces!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the surroundings, find the missing pieces, unlock doors, activate electrical devices, and complete the level. If you can't find the answer, our scientist will help you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540580?t=1744820521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/e2cf3e6323ca39e961fe25a0691f76c55e56ff77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744820521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/d8350e94a71f82a5808964c626e0bd038675d5b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744820521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/d8350e94a71f82a5808964c626e0bd038675d5b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744820521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elemental Slime is a puzzle platformer game where you use the power of the elements to solve puzzles, interact with the world around you and unravel mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/elements.png?t=1744820521\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/Fire_Element.gif?t=1744820521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...are key to solutions!</strong></p><p c